OL,3,GNEWSALollipop lady's plea amid school
OL,4,Acrossing patrol shortage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lancashire lollipop lady who has
OL,7,Fworked at the same school crossing for
OL,8,Fmore than 30 years has urged people to
OL,9,Ffollow in her footsteps.
OL,11,FGill Rimmer has helped children cross
OL,12,Fthe busy Hugh Barn Lane outside New
OL,13,FLongton All Saints' Church of England
OL,14,FPrimary School in New Longton, Preston,
OL,15,Ffor 31 years.
OL,17,FThe grandmother said she still loved
OL,18,Fthe job and had no plans to stop.
OL,20,FBut Lancashire County Council said
OL,21,Fthere are several vacancies for school
OL,22,Fcrossing patrol officers.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
